WEBVTT

NOTE
This file was generated by Descript <www.descript.com>

00:00:00.330 --> 00:00:03.969
Leah: Nearly 10 percent of children
and young people experience behavioural

00:00:04.010 --> 00:00:08.130
or emotional problems growing up and
for most, these will resolve in time

00:00:08.150 --> 00:00:11.620
but for others, it won’t, and they
will need more professional support.

00:00:12.280 --> 00:00:15.679
Rhiannon: It can be difficult to know
when a child or young person is suffering

00:00:16.070 --> 00:00:20.750
but significant changes in behaviour,
difficulties with sleep, withdrawal or

00:00:20.750 --> 00:00:24.430
not wanting to do things they usually
like to do, will be a potential sign.

00:00:24.540 --> 00:00:27.860
Leah: Children with long term medical
conditions are more likely to suffer from

00:00:27.869 --> 00:00:29.989
emotional problems or disturbed behaviour.

00:00:30.630 --> 00:00:33.900
They may start to rebel or
withdraw from social settings.

00:00:34.459 --> 00:00:37.680
Rhiannon: They may be susceptible to
using other methods to control their

00:00:37.680 --> 00:00:39.660
problems such as self-medicating.

00:00:40.440 --> 00:00:44.630
Teenagers as they grow up, start to get
moody and worried about how they look,

00:00:44.860 --> 00:00:48.489
what other people think of them and
this can affect the way they behave.

00:00:48.730 --> 00:00:52.680
They may change their eating habits
even becoming anorexic or bulimic,

00:00:52.959 --> 00:00:54.669
and indulge in risky behaviours.

00:00:55.710 --> 00:00:59.720
Leah: Self-harm is more common in
teenage girls than in boys, but boys

00:00:59.720 --> 00:01:04.749
and young men are at a higher risk of
suicide, however suicide rates are on

00:01:04.750 --> 00:01:06.599
the increase with young women also.

00:01:07.059 --> 00:01:11.270
Cutting can become habit forming and
many people who self-harm, take care

00:01:11.320 --> 00:01:15.634
to hide any scars and self-harmers can
be unpredictable with their ‘tools’.

00:01:15.634 --> 00:01:20.040
Rhiannon: When it comes to addiction,
young people will not often seek help

00:01:20.380 --> 00:01:24.999
but will present with other problems such
as difficulties at school, inappropriate

00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:27.600
sexual behaviour or signs of depression.

00:01:28.520 --> 00:01:31.510
They may even start lying or
stealing to feed their drug habit.

00:01:32.460 --> 00:01:35.669
Leah: Behavioural and conduct problems
may be related to other complaints,

00:01:35.680 --> 00:01:40.679
such as ADHD, specific learning
difficulties, abuse, or social influences.

00:01:41.150 --> 00:01:44.200
This can have a negative impact,
not only on the child or young

00:01:44.200 --> 00:01:45.950
person but on the whole family.

00:01:46.830 --> 00:01:50.610
Rhiannon: Eating disorders not only
affect the individual mentally, but

00:01:50.610 --> 00:01:54.750
they also affect them physically and
in extreme cases can cause death.

00:01:55.620 --> 00:01:59.139
Anorexia in girls, causes problems
with their periods stopping

00:01:59.429 --> 00:02:00.850
and other health problems.

00:02:01.700 --> 00:02:05.660
Bulimia and the excessive use of
laxatives can cause physical damage

00:02:05.850 --> 00:02:09.289
and regular vomiting can dissolve
and erode the teeth over time.

00:02:10.250 --> 00:02:14.610
Leah: Psychosis can be caused by substance
abuse or can be a signal of an underlying

00:02:14.610 --> 00:02:18.750
physical illness such as a severe
infection, or a severe mental illness

00:02:18.790 --> 00:02:20.669
like bipolar disorder or schizophrenia.

00:02:21.620 --> 00:02:24.970
Children and young people are often not
aware that they have a problem, until

00:02:24.970 --> 00:02:30.730
it becomes a problem and this is where
parents, carers, friends, family, teachers

00:02:31.070 --> 00:02:35.360
and anyone who knows them well, should
be aware of changes in behaviour or mood.

00:02:36.110 --> 00:02:39.340
Rhiannon: If they are starting to
behave differently or show distress

00:02:39.370 --> 00:02:43.190
or mood swings it should be a warning
that something isn’t right, and it

00:02:43.190 --> 00:02:46.240
might be time to talk to someone
about it before things go too far.

